That's what killed me for my first [large number] games.  You pretty
much have to focus *hard* through that entire first ascension, and
teach yourself not to gamble.  Luck (the real-life kind), aside from
things like spawning on top of a trap, should not play much of a
factor -- every game will have both good things and bad things
happening to you continuously.

I relied heavily on AoLS for my first several ascensions.  Eventually
I stopped needing them, but they saved a lot of promising games from a
lot of dumb mistakes.  I'd generally spend my first wish on one, then
replace it as soon as it was used.


